      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Don't hand off on a workflow nobody ran",
      "prov:value": "Check when that workflow **last ran**, too. A repo can carry a CI file that\nhas not executed in months: when a verification workflow sits red and\nundispatched on `main`, dozens of modules can stop compiling — some with parse\nerrors, meaning they never compiled at all — and nothing catches it because\nnothing runs."
    }
